{"title":"Career Roadmap: Cyber Forensics Assistant","role":"Cyber Forensics Assistant","summary":"A Cyber Forensics Assistant supports investigations involving digital devices, electronic evidence and cyber incidents.","facts":{"Current degree":"B.Sc. (Bachelor of Science – General / Honours)","Course":"Forensic Science"},"about":[{"label":"Primary Goal","text":"Develop foundations in forensic science, computer systems, digital evidence handling, cyber investigation, incident analysis and forensic reporting"}],"intro":[],"horizons":[],"sections":[{"heading":"Overview","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Career Roadmap Overview"},{"type":"p","text":"A Cyber Forensics Assistant supports investigations involving digital devices, electronic evidence and cyber incidents."},{"type":"p","text":"Typical responsibilities can include:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Digital evidence preservation"},{"text":"Computer and mobile-device examination"},{"text":"File-system analysis"},{"text":"Log analysis"},{"text":"Evidence documentation"},{"text":"Data recovery"},{"text":"Timeline reconstruction"},{"text":"Malware-analysis support"},{"text":"Network-forensics support"},{"text":"Forensic reporting"},{"text":"Evidence-chain documentation"}]},{"type":"p","text":"The role sits at the intersection of:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Forensic Science","Computer Science","Cybersecurity","Investigation"],"sep":"+"},{"type":"p","text":"A B.Sc. Forensic Science provides the forensic foundation, but the student should deliberately build Linux, networking, operating systems, scripting and digital-forensics skills."}]},{"heading":"What to Build During UG","kind":"build","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["Year","Build This","Learn From","Proof to Create","Gap to Avoid"],"rows":[[{"text":"1st Year"},{"text":"Forensic & computing foundation"},{"text":"Forensic science, computer fundamentals"},{"text":"Evidence-handling portfolio"},{"text":"Weak computer fundamentals"}],[{"text":"2nd Ye